          "returnType": "void",
          "description": "Freeze the running automation at its current value without releasing the note. Used when a voice is paused: the scheduled ramps must not keep advancing against audioContext.currentTime while nothing is audible. Unlike Envelope.release this keeps the trigger bookkeeping, so the envelope can be picked up again with trigger(param, now, elapsedMs)."
        },
